title: 'Gnome persona mod: founder endorses the guardrails'
summary: 'Founder: "i like your points". Endorsed the five framing points for the gnome persona mod (concept doc in progress at docs/specs/gnomon-mods/gnome-persona.md). Founder is now reviewing the Atelier REVIEW.html.'
symbols_touched:
  - '#paradigm-harness'
decisions:
  - id: P8-D45
    decision: 'Relay token claims stay honest: restyling does not cut generation tokens; savings come from brief-by-instruction, dialog choices that narrow follow-ups, and a local model doing the restyle'
    rationale: Founder endorsed.
  - id: P8-D46
    decision: The relay never rephrases approval cards, refusals, billing, security or certification text; raw output is always one key away and logged; dialog lines mark quote vs paraphrase
    rationale: Kernel regions are unreplaceable per spec; founder endorsed.
  - id: P8-D47
    decision: 'Personality without capability claims: ''understood'' means acknowledged receipt, never ''I understand'''
    rationale: Calibrated-trust research (rules.yaml ai-agent space); founder endorsed.
  - id: P8-D48
    decision: Emotes are driven by kernel events first (approval, refusal, error, certify); custom phrase triggers are a secondary layer
    rationale: Emotes must reflect what actually happened; founder endorsed.
  - id: P8-D49
    decision: 'A gnome is a skin plus protocol over the model: a persona:v1 manifest (tone, length budget, vocabulary, phrase-to-emote map, body + hat, palette) editable live by any agent through the mod ABI'
    rationale: Founder's framing, endorsed.
